            <title>[IGNITE-3846] Some of the job execution events are recorded for internal tasks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3846</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridTaskWorker.recordJobEvent(..)&lt;/tt&gt; method doesn&apos;t filter out internal tasks. This is how the code should look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!internal &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ctx.event().isRecordable(evtType)) {
    ...
